 {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}) \\\\  & =(1,3]\\cup ∅ \\\\  & =(1,3].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1043 #edb/ref 17592186415190 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1043 #edb/ref 17592186415191 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1043 #edb/ref 17592186415192 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1043 #edb/ref 17592186415193 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1045 "Conditional Statements With Predicates" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1046 #edb/ref 17592186415192 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046673 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048574 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415162 1053 #uuid "c363db75-51e2-54dd-b22d-923d77f8fec9" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415163 1080 "$x$ is not a multiple of $10,$ or $x$ is not a multiple of $5.$" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415163 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415163 1083 #uuid "0f7f518c-488c-5d96-b7a5-43db3205b127" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415164 1080 "I and II only" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415164 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415164 1083 #uuid "1f5642c9-3238-501d-b001-abe804dbf74b" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415165 1080 "$x$ is a multiple of $10,$ and $x$ is a multiple of $5.$" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415165 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415165 1083 #uuid "2a18ce88-661b-56f1-ab50-d4c0c0d859f1" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415166 1080 "$x$ is a multiple of $10,$ or $x$ is a multiple of $5.$" 13194139534233 17592186045417 true] [17592186415166 1